# Tiny MPI smoke test used to check
# if the system is running properly 
# before runing huge batch file
clear
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 1 1 1 units box
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 1.122
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
thermo 1
run 0
